    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Pursuant to the Agreement and Plan of Merger, dated as of August 1, 2026, by and among Indivior Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (&quot;Indivior&quot;), Artemis Merger Sub Inc. and Supernus Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (&quot;Supernus Pharmaceuticals&quot;), at the effective time of the merger on 11/2/2026, each outstanding Supernus Pharmaceuticals equity award was assumed by Indivior (renamed Supernus, Inc.) and automatically converted into a corresponding Supernus, Inc. equity award covering the number of Supernus, Inc. shares equal to the number of Supernus Pharmaceuticals shares subject to the award multiplied by the 1.5401 exchange ratio (rounded down), with the per-share exercise price divided by the exchange ratio and rounded up to the nearest whole cent. Each converted award is subject to substantially the same terms and conditions, including vesting, that applied immediately prior to the effective time, except performance stock unit awards ceased were converted into time-vesting restricted stock units.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The option vests in four equal annual installments beginning on August 17, 2024.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">The option vests on February 22, 2025.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">The option vests on February 19, 2026.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">Each option vests on February 18, 2027.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F6">Each restricted stock unit represents the right to receive one share of Supernus common stock upon vesting.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F7">These restricted stock units will be settled in common stock upon vesting, which will occur on February 18, 2027.</footnote>
    </footnotes>

